ul in interior si in aer liber. Nu contine: BPA, ftalati, latex. Este usor de depozitat.</li>\n<li>Aceasta jucarie nu este doar un simplu instrument de distractie, ci si un adevarat joc pentru dezvoltarea abilitatilor. Pe langa faptul ca ii amuza, jucaria le stimuleaza curiozitatea, inspira jocul imaginativ si le dezvolta echilibrul, capacitatea de coordonare, abilitatile motorii de baza, abilitatile sociale, creativitatea si imaginatia.</li>\n<li>Prin aspectul simplu si varietatea mare de utilizare, Bilibo garanteaza ca timpul petrecut cu acest joc va fi amuzant si placut si, nu in ultimul rand, foarte util!</li>\n<li>Varsta recomandata: 2-8 ani.</li>\n<li>Dimensiuni: 39 x 39 x 22 cm</li>\n</ul>", "on_sale": true, "prices": {"price": "11900", "regular_price": "14900", "sale_price": "11900", "price_range": null, "currency_code": "RON", "currency_symbol": "lei", "currency_minor_unit": 2, "currency_decimal_separator": ",", "currency_thousand_separator": "", "currency_prefix": "", "currency_suffix": " lei"}, "price_html": "<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">149,00&nbsp;<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">lei</span></span></del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Pre\u021bul ini\u021bial a fost: 149,00&nbsp;lei.</span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">119,00&nbsp;<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">lei</span></span></ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Pre\u021bul curent este: 119,00&nbsp;lei.</span>", "average_rating": "0", "review_count": 0, "images": [{"id": 781321, "src": "https://www.creatoys.ro/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Moluk-Bilibo-Mint-1.jpg", "thumbnail": "https://www.creatoys.ro/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Moluk-Bilibo-Mint-1-300x300.jpg", "srcset": "https://www.creatoys.ro/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Moluk-Bilibo-Mint-1.jpg 1000w, https://www.creatoys.ro/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Moluk-Bilibo-Mint-1-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.creatoys.ro/wp-content/u