ien\u021b\u0103 de construc\u021bie f\u0103r\u0103 frustrare.</p>", "description": "<h3>Construie\u0219te mai sus, mai stabil \u0219i mai creativ</h3>\n<p>MAGNA-TILES microMAGS Cubes aduce o abordare nou\u0103 \u00een lumea construc\u021biilor magnetice, permi\u021b\u00e2nd copiilor s\u0103 construiasc\u0103 turnuri, structuri \u0219i forme 3D stabile. Designul cuburilor faciliteaz\u0103 alinierea \u0219i conectarea rapid\u0103, oferind succes imediat \u00een joac\u0103.</p>\n<h3>8 magne\u021bi per cub pentru stabilitate superioar\u0103</h3>\n<p>Fiecare cub este echipat cu 8 magne\u021bi puternici, ceea ce \u00eel face mult mai stabil dec\u00e2t blocurile clasice de construc\u021bie. Aceast\u0103 structur\u0103 inovatoare ajut\u0103 copiii s\u0103 creeze construc\u021bii solide \u00een toate direc\u021biile \u2013 vertical, orizontal \u0219i diagonal.</p>\n<h3>Joac\u0103 portabil\u0103 cu hus\u0103 de depozitare inclus\u0103</h3>\n<p>Setul vine cu o hus\u0103 practic\u0103 de transport, transparent\u0103 \u0219i prevazut\u0103 cu fermoar, ideal\u0103 pentru c\u0103l\u0103torii sau organizare acas\u0103. Astfel, copiii pot lua cu ei joaca magnetic\u0103 oriunde, f\u0103r\u0103 pierderea pieselor \u0219i f\u0103r\u0103 efort de organizare.</p>\n<h2>De ce s\u0103 alegi acest produs?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ofer\u0103 o experien\u021b\u0103 de construc\u021bie 3D stabil\u0103 \u0219i intuitiv\u0103 pentru copii mici</li>\n<li>Fiecare cub are 8 magne\u021bi pentru conectare sigur\u0103 \u0219i rezisten\u021b\u0103 sporit\u0103</li>\n<li>\u00cencurajeaz\u0103 construirea f\u0103r\u0103 frustrare, cresc\u00e2nd \u00eencrederea copilului</li>\n<li>Include cutie de depozitare pentru transport u\u0219or \u0219i organizare</li>\n<li>Compatibil cu toate seturile MAGNA-TILES pentru construc\u021bii extinse</li>\n<li>Ideal pentru joac\u0103 acas\u0103, la gr\u0103dini\u021b\u0103 sau \u00een c\u0103l\u0103torii</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Caracteristici principale</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Set magnetic de construc\u021bie format din 9 cuburi</li>\n<li>Fiecare cub con\u021bine 8 magne\u021bi integra\u021bi pentru stabilitate maxim\u0103</li>\n<li>Permite construc\u021bii verticale, orizontale \u0219i 3D</li>\n<li>Design colorat, atractiv pentru copii mici</li>\n<li>Include hus\u0103 de depozitare</li>\n<li>Sistem de conectare magnetic\u0103 u\u0219or \u0219i intuitiv</li>\n<li>Fabricat din plastic MABS alimentar, non-toxic</li>\n<li>F\u0103r\u0103 BPA, ftala\u021bi \u0219i latex</li>\n<li>Compatibil cu toate seturile MAGNA-TILES</li>\n<li>Recomandat pentru copii cu v\u00e2rsta: <strong>2+ ani</strong></li>\n<li>Dimensiune set:<strong> 22 x 12 x 5 cm</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Beneficii educa\u021bionale</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dezvolt\u0103 g\u00e2ndirea spa\u021bial\u0103 \u0219i \u00een\u021belegerea structurilor 3D</li>\n<li>\u00cembun\u0103t\u0103\u021be\u0219te coordonarea m\u00e2n\u0103-ochi \u0219i motricitatea fin\u0103</li>\n<li>Stimuleaz\u0103 creativitatea \u0219i imagina\u021bia prin construc\u021bii libere</li>\n<li>Sus\u021bine \u00eenv\u0103\u021barea prin experimentare \u0219i rezolvare de probleme</li>\n<li>Cre\u0219te \u00eencrederea copilului prin succes rapid \u00een construc\u021bii</li>\n<li>Introduce concepte STEM: echilibru, structur\u0103 \u0219i simetrie</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Con\u021binut pachet</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>9 cuburi magnetice microMAGS \u00een culori asortate</li>\n<li>Fiecare cub con\u021bine 8 magne\u021bi puternici integra\u021bi</li>\n<li>1 hus\u0103 de transport</li>\n<li>Set complet gata de utilizare</li>\n</ul>", "on_sale": false, "prices": {"price": "11900", "regular_price": "11900", "sale_price": "11900", "price_range": null, "currency_code": "RON", "currency_symbol": "lei", "currency_minor_unit": 2, "currency_decimal_separator": ",", "currency_thousand_separator": "", "currency_prefix": "", "currency_suffix": " lei"}, "price_html": "<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">119,00&nbsp;<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">lei