m \u0219i g\u00e2ndirea logic\u0103 \u00eentr-un mod distractiv \u0219i interactiv.</p>", "description": "<h3>Joc educativ clasic pentru copii</h3>\n<p>Stacking Rings este o juc\u0103rie simpl\u0103 dar extrem de eficient\u0103 \u00een dezvoltarea abilit\u0103\u021bilor timpurii ale copiilor. Prin aranjarea inelelor colorate pe st\u00e2lp, cei mici pot \u00eenv\u0103\u021ba s\u0103 compare dimensiunile, culorile \u0219i pot exersa abilit\u0103\u021bile de stivuire \u00eentr-un mod juc\u0103u\u0219 \u0219i plin de descoperire.</p>\n<h3>Dezvoltare prin joac\u0103 activ\u0103</h3>\n<p>Designul colorat \u0219i u\u0219or de manipulat permite copiilor s\u0103 \u00eenve\u021be \u00een ritmul lor, stimul\u00e2nd curiozitatea \u0219i dorin\u021ba de a rezolva probleme prin \u00eencerc\u0103ri repetate. Juc\u0103ria este potrivit\u0103 at\u00e2t pentru acas\u0103, c\u00e2t \u0219i pentru gr\u0103dini\u021b\u0103 sau centre educa\u021bionale.</p>\n<h2>De ce s\u0103 alegi acest produs?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Joc educativ conceput pentru dezvoltarea motricit\u0103\u021bii fine \u0219i coordon\u0103rii ochi-m\u00e2n\u0103</li>\n<li>Culori vibrante \u0219i design prietenos pentru copii, cu o mica figurin\u0103 de eschimo\u0219 \u00een v\u00e2rf</li>\n<li>Material durabil din lemn de calitate, sigur pentru cei mici</li>\n<li>Potrivit pentru acas\u0103, gr\u0103dini\u021b\u0103 sau spa\u021bii educa\u021bionale</li>\n<li>Stimuleaz\u0103 \u00eenv\u0103\u021barea prin joac\u0103 activ\u0103 \u0219i explorare</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Caracteristici principale</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tip produs: juc\u0103rie educativ\u0103 cu inele de stivuit</li>\n<li><a id=\"_Hlk223433267\"></a>Dimensiuni: 19 \u00d7 13 \u00d7 13 cm</li>\n<li>V\u00e2rst\u0103 recomandat\u0103: 18 luni +</li>\n<li>Material: lemn durabil, vopsit cu vopsele netoxice</li>\n<li>Design: culori atractive \u0219i forme u\u0219or de recunoscut</li>\n<li>Potrivit pentru joac\u0103 individual\u0103 sau \u00een grup</li>\n<li>Ideal pentru: dezvoltare timpurie, coordonare, joc liber</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Beneficii educa\u021bionale</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Coordonare ochi-m\u00e2n\u0103</strong>: manipularea inelelor \u00eembun\u0103t\u0103\u021be\u0219te controlul mi\u0219c\u0103rilor</li>\n<li> <strong>Recunoa\u0219terea formelor \u0219i culorilor</strong>: copiii \u00eenva\u021b\u0103 diferen\u021bierea vizual\u0103</li>\n<li><strong>G\u00e2ndire logic\u0103</strong>: ordonarea inelelor dup\u0103 m\u0103rime stimuleaz\u0103 ra\u021bionamentul</li>\n<li><strong>Concentrare \u0219i r\u0103bdare</strong>: provocarea de a stivui corect inelele dezvolt\u0103 focusul </li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Con\u021binut pachet</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>1 x Baz\u0103 cu st\u00e2lp pentru stivuit inele</li>\n<li>8 x Inele colorate de diferite dimensiuni  + 1 figurina de eschimos \u00een v\u00e2rf</li>\n</ul>", "on_sale": true, "prices": {"price": "7990", "regular_price": "8990", "sale_price": "7990", "price_range": null, "currency_code": "RON", "currency_symbol": "lei", "currency_minor_unit": 2, "currency_decimal_separator": ",", "currency_thousand_separator": "", "currency_prefix": "", "currency_suffix": " lei"}, "price_html": "<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">89,90&nbsp;<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">lei</span></span></del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Pre\u021bul ini\u021bial a fost: 89,90&nbsp;lei.</span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">79,90&nbsp;<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">lei</span></span></ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Pre\u021bul curent este: 79,90&nbsp;lei.</span>", "average_rating": "0", "review_count": 0, "images": [{"id": 885038, "src": "https://www.creatoys.ro/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/BS-Toys-GA544-Stacking-Rings-4.webp", "thumbnail": "https://www.creatoys.ro/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/BS-Toys-GA544-Stacking-Rings-4-300x300.webp", "srcset": "https://www.creatoys.ro/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/BS-Toys-GA544-St